// The Blank's islands (bible 4.7, 8.6, 10: "the Blank is built from your choices"). Every place Wren left to the
// Blank drifts here, and its people react to how she left it. Five are authored, one per [B] commission (Islands);
// any other released place speaks from Island_Remnant.
// Remnant voice (style guide §4): half-sentences, present tense, polite; ask whether you've eaten; never "I'm dead".

title: Island_Merrow_Dotha
---
<<if has_flag("blank.merrow.visited")>>
    Dotha: Eleven. Still eleven. The water's a better audience here. #still #line:0a5bc77
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Dotha: You. Sit if you're sitting. #line:02fb130
Dotha: Eleven songs. I have all eleven here. The two that went with people came back with them. #line:04a9762
<<if flag("saltmarrow.dotha.decided") == 2>>
    Dotha: You let it go. Kind. You said so, and it was. #line:0678c1d
<<else>>
    Dotha: Nobody held it. So here it is. Roofs and all. Forty of them. #line:07278f2
<<endif>>
-> Sing me the eleventh. #line:05aad31
    Dotha: It's about a stranger on the stoop. It's short. Everything true is. #line:0d9fdf6
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> Do you want to come back? #line:0a20145
    Dotha: I don't ask twice. I asked once. You answered. #line:05f29ce
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ... #line:04f07a0
    Dotha: Quiet one. The white likes you too. #line:0bac9ce
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.merrow.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Hollowvein
---
<<if has_flag("blank.hollowvein.visited")>>
    <<if has_flag("blank.hollowvein.called")>>
        Brask: Thirty-one. Answered. Tell Runa we heard. #still #line:0d0ec85
    <<else>>
        Brask: Still listening. Have you eaten? #still #line:0e87221
    <<endif>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Brask: Is it the roll-call? We've been listening for it. Thirty-one of us, standing. #line:007c1d8
Brask: Nobody's called us. Have you eaten? There's nothing. You're welcome to it. #line:0ea0261
-> I know the roll-call. <<if walk_known()>> #line:0f942f9
    Brask: Then call it. We'll answer. Every one. #line:06fc629
    Mine: Thirty-one names, into the white. Thirty-one answers, out of it. #line:0ccddef
    <<flag blank.hollowvein.called 1>>
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> Runa counts you every night. #line:0a036ce
    Brask: Runa? Kettil's girl? She was this high. She counts us? #line:0653290
    Brask: Then we're counted. That's something. That's a lot. #line:0b1c404
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> ... #line:06d7962
    Brask: That's what the Guild said too. Sit, anyway. #line:0c5d705
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.hollowvein.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Aldermere
---
<<if has_flag("blank.aldermere.visited")>>
    Hollin: Still tonight. Still bread. Come back any time; it's tonight. #still #line:014fa1a
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Hollin: Cartographer! You came to the festival. It's still tonight. It's tonight all night. #line:0946efd
Hollin: Have you eaten? There's bread. There's bread till morning, and morning's a long way. #line:042703f
Hollin: We would rather be remembered than kept. And you remembered. Look at us. #line:0fdea9c
-> It's a good festival. #line:06bffe4
    Hollin: The best. We only had the one. We made it last. #line:09b7f57
    <<voice drift blank>>
-> Teodor sits with you every evening. #line:03787d1
    Hollin: Teodor! Tell him the bread's still warm. Tell him he was right. #line:0a5684c
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> Do you want to be held? #line:0c0eeda
    Hollin: Held? We're dancing. Ask me after. There isn't an after. Ha! #line:0fe80c4
    <<voice warden blank>>
<<flag blank.aldermere.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Inn
---
<<if has_flag("blank.inn.visited")>>
    Innkeeper: The same soup. Sit. #still #line:0b3d91b
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Innkeeper: Traveller. The road brought you. It does, one night in a long while. #line:0175b05
Innkeeper: Have you eaten? The soup is the same soup. Nobody minds. Sit. #line:0f49fba
-> Who else is on the road? #line:058d2e7
    Innkeeper: Everyone who took it. Nobody who's coming. Salt? #line:0755b57
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> I came through the gate. Again. #line:0db29f5
    Innkeeper: Twice! A regular. We'll keep your chair. #line:05697d8
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ... #line:0689a60
    Innkeeper: Quiet ones eat more. Here. #line:052e947
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.inn.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Lowmarket
---
<<if has_flag("blank.lowmarket.visited")>>
    Brisk: The mill turns. Nobody's paid. Nobody's owed. #still #line:0ee1b4f
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Brisk: Journeyman. You stayed out. Fair. It wasn't your strike. #line:0bbf76d
Brisk: No owners here. No wages. No survey. Just the mill, turning, and us. #line:0e4fd36
Brisk: Have you eaten? There's paper. You can't eat paper. Force of habit. #line:00c7843
-> Are you glad? #line:08530dc
    Brisk: Nobody's owed anything here. I thought I'd like it more. #line:067125b
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> I should have stepped in. #line:018ffdb
    Brisk: Maybe. We'd have been kept, then. Same bread forever. Pick your forever. #line:0d7b920
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ... #line:0b05062
    Brisk: Aye. The mill says that too. #line:01ba5be
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.lowmarket.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Half
---
// A half-island (blank-islands.md): an anchored place whose seal was loosened, a memory of it given away. The place
// stands where it is, held; its people drift in half-remembered.
Remnant: A visitor. Have you— no. We haven't a table. We haven't a— #line:0a92863
Remnant: There was a place. It's still there. We're not. Somebody gave us away. #still #line:06a3364
-> I gave your memory to a door. #line:06bc7d6
    Remnant: A door. Was it a good door? We hope so. We hope it's a good door. #line:0433f6e
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> The place is still standing. Anchored. #line:04804b5
    Remnant: Yes. The place is. Say hello to it. It won't— it won't say it back. #line:0d2d9aa
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ... #line:07e2d71
    Remnant: Yes. We're like that too, now. Half of something. Sit, if there's a sit. #line:051b39b
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.half.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Remnant
---
Remnant: Oh. A visitor. We don't— have you eaten? #line:0683cd2
Remnant: This is a place. It was on a map, once. You drew it, maybe. #still #line:0b4bdd1
-> I left it unanchored. #line:0747ffd
    Remnant: Then it's here. That's where unanchored goes. It's not bad. It's quiet. #line:0384314
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> Do you want to come back? #line:069da2a
    Remnant: Back? We're here. Where's back? #line:0359d47
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ... #line:0d31d1f
    Remnant: Yes. Like that. Sit a while. #line:03008b2
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.remnant.visited 1>>
===
